2. Is it acceptable for a role delegated during Emergency mode to be revoked at the precise transition to Normal mode, or is a grace period (or explicit action) required for revocation?
  Why needed: The model currently requires immediate revocation, which may block the witnessing of a delegation both during and after Emergency; clarifying this will allow alignment of the model and requirements.

3. Should the requirement-witness predicate DelegationCoverage demonstrate that a delegation during Emergency exists at any time (even if revoked immediately at Emergency end), or must such a delegation persist into Normal mode for coverage?
