R7: Request Processing Logging  
R7.1: For every request (regardless of outcome), the system must record the processor responsible for the request.

R8: Delegation Coverage Verification  
R8.1: For verification, the DelegationCoverage predicate must demonstrate that a delegation exists at any time during Emergency mode, and a (possibly different) delegation exists at any time during Normal mode. These are two distinct delegation instances; cross-mode persistence is not required or permitted for this witness.
